:: Xavier Hang Out Go To Park [nobr]

/* Intro */
You think for a moment about where to go before asking <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> what he thinks of the park. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I think I’m fine going wherever you want to go.”</span> He responds, sounding a bit amused. You nod and decide, park it is. As you both begin walking over there, <span style="Color: Yellow">you notice <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> giving you a curious look and ask him what’s up.</span> <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Sorry to answer your question with a question, <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">$XavierNickname</span>.”</span> He replies, stopping for a moment and crossing his arms, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“Why the park? What about it made you choose that? Or was it more of a spur of the moment thing? I assumed you had a plan when you asked me to accompany you, but maybe it was more on impulse?”</span><br>

<<set _ad to [
	{
		Name: "Xavier",
		State: {
            Outfit: $HangOutClothes,
            Mouth: "Smirk",
            Eyes: "Tired",
		},
	},
	{
		Name: "Player",
		State: {
			Mouth: "Happy",
		},
	},
]>>
<<ad _ad>>

<div id="choice">
	<<link "You enjoy the playground<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        Maybe a little embarrassed to admit this, you tell <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> that you like playing on the playground. You have one near your house, but the one at the park is much bigger. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I see.”</span> <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> laughs, <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I think it’s very cute how you still enjoy the childish things in life. I’m not one for running around myself, but, if you want, I wouldn’t be against pushing you on the swings.”</span> <span style="Color: LightGreen">You nod, unsure if he is making fun of you or not.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Xavier Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
	<<link "You like nature<br>">>
    <<replace"#choice">>
        You think for a moment before admitting that you just like nature. The trees, the pond, the animals wandering about. It’s pretty relaxing, especially after a hard day at school. <span style="color:DarkTurquoise">Xavier</span> nods along with a thoughtful expression. <span style="Color: LightSteelBlue">“I see. I have to admit, I can see the appeal, though the masses that congregate there normally turn me off of the place. Maybe we could go to the woods together sometime, alone. I feel we could have a much more relaxing time in private.”</span> <span style="Color: Pink">He gives you a smirk that worries you as you continue along to your destination.</span> <br>
        <br>
        [[Continue|Xavier Hang Out Park]]
    <</replace>>
    <</link>>
</div>